cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  IVF Digital Twin: An Integrated Multi-Source Ensemble Platform for
  Stage-Stratified IVF Outcome Prediction
message: >-
  If you use this software in research, please cite it using the metadata
  in this file.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sergeev
    given-names: Sergei
