    given-names: Tamara
repository-code: 'https://github.com/embryossa/IVF-Digital-Twin'
abstract: >-
  A source-available ensemble platform for stage-stratified prediction of
  IVF outcomes, combining Bayesian modelling, gradient boosting, tabular
  deep learning (FT-Transformer / Mambular), graph neural networks and
  diffusion-based synthesis across the follicle to live-birth funnel.
  Includes clinic-specific calibration, conformal prediction intervals,
  and retrieval-grounded narrative reporting.
keywords:
  - IVF
  - assisted reproductive technology
  - clinical prediction model
  - digital twin
  - machine learning
  - embryology
